\n\nI'm now focusing on implementing the translation updates within my Python script, specifically adding new keys and translations for Vietnamese and English. I'm carefully incorporating `stride_window`, `enable_double_check`, `ai_mode`, `pool_name`, and `max_retries` into the language files, using `ruamel.yaml` to ensure correct formatting and avoid potential corruption. The next step is testing these changes.\n\n\n**Incorporating New Strings**\n\nI'm now incorporating newly identified UI strings into the translation process. This includes adding translations for 'Max number of characters per request', 'System Prompt Profile', and 'Merge Nearby Boxes' in both English and Vietnamese. I am also working on `ui_font_scale`, `ui_appearance_theme`, `ui_select_theme`, `ui_advanced_settings`, and `ui_load_test_image`. This is being done to enhance the user experience by providing localized text.\n\n\n**Adding UI Enhancements**\n\nI'm now integrating new UI strings related to export and tab functionalities. This encompasses adding translations for 'Fast Preview', 'Reset View', and button labels for exporting images, OCR data, translations, inpainted images, and rendered outputs, in both English and Vietnamese, which will significantly enrich user interaction.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"cat << 'EOF' > scratch/patch_langs.py\\nimport os\\nimport glob\\nfrom ruamel.yaml import YAML\\n\\nyaml = YAML()\\nyaml.preserve_quotes = True\\nyaml.indent(mapping=2, sequence=4, offset=2)\\n\\nnew_tabs = {\\n    'Output Export': { 'en': 'Output Export', 'vi': 'Trích xuất & Đầu ra' }\\n}\\n\\nnew_settings = {\\n    'memory_mode': {'en': {'label': 'Memory Mode', 'tooltip': 'Choose how the application handles memory for large contexts.'}, 'vi': {'label': 'Chế độ bộ nhớ', 'tooltip': 'Cách xử lý bộ nhớ ngữ cảnh.'}},\\n    'context_window': {'en': {'label': 'Context Window', 'tooltip': 'Number of sentences to keep in context window.'}, 'vi': {'label': 'C