{"step_index":1042,"source":"MODEL","type":"RUN_COMMAND","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-07-11T14:28:31Z","content":"Created At: 2026-07-11T14:28:31Z\nCompleted At: 2026-07-11T14:28:33Z\n\n\t\t\t\tThe command completed successfully.\n\t\t\t\tOutput:\n\t\t\t\t<truncated 1 lines>\ncommended for most comics.\n  detection_size:\n    label: 'Detection Size:'\n    tooltip: The resolution the image is resized to for text detection. Higher v\nalues find smaller text but are slower.\n  ocr:\n    label: 'OCR Model:'\n    tooltip: The AI model used to read/recognize the characters inside the text\nbubbles.\n  ignore_bubble:\n    label: 'Ignore Small Bubbles:'\n    tooltip: Ignores any detected text bubbles smaller than this pixel area. Use\nful for filtering out noise or tiny sound effects.\n  use_mocr_merge:\n    label: Use mOCR Merge\n    tooltip: A special mode for the 'mocr' model that can improve accuracy on di\nfficult fonts, but is slightly slower.\n  text_threshold:\n    label: 'Text Threshold:'\n    tooltip: How confident the detector must be to mark an area as 'text'. Lower\n values find more text but may include noise.\n  box_threshold:\n    label: 'Box Threshold:'\n    tooltip: How confident the detector must be to finalize the bounding box aro\nund the text. Higher values create tighter, more precise boxes.\n  unclip_ratio:\n    label: 'Unclip Ratio:'\n    tooltip: How much to expand the detected text box to capture outlines or par\nts of speech bubbles. Too high can cause boxes to merge.\n  det_rotate:\n    label: Detect Rotated Text\n    tooltip: Enables detection of vertically or rotated text within a bubble.\n  det_auto_rotate:\n    label: Auto-Rotate Image\n    tooltip: Automatically rotates the entire image if it's detected to be sidew\nays before processing.\n  det_invert:\n    label: Invert Image Colors\n    tooltip: Inverts the image colors (black to white and vice-versa) before det\nection. Useful for white text on black backgrounds.\n  det_gamma_correct:\n    label: Gamma Correction\n    tooltip: Applies gamma correction before detection. Can improve detection on\n certain image types.\n  min_text_length:\n    label: 'Min. Text Length:'\n    tooltip: Ignores any recognized text\n<truncated 4235 bytes>\neading Order\n    tooltip: Enable for content that is read right-to-left, like manga. This ens\nures speech bubbles are processed in the correct order.\n  font_size_minimum:\n    label: 'Min. Font Size:'\n    tooltip: Prevents font size from falling below this value. -1 disables this\nfeature.\n\n  api_key_manager:\n    label: Manage API Keys\n    tooltip: Manage your translation API keys securely.\n  enable_verbose_output:\n    label: Enable Verbose Output ⚠\n    tooltip: 'WARNING: Saves all intermediate processing steps (masks, OCR boxes\n, etc.) for debugging. This will consume a very large amount of disk space and s\nlow down processing.'\n  app_language:\n    label: 'App Language:'\n    tooltip: Choo\n    tooltip: Choose the language of the application interface (labels and toolti\nps).\n  ocr_api_endpoint:\n    placeholder: e.g., https://api.openai.com/v1\n  ocr_api_model:\n    placeholder: e.g., gemini-2.5-flash\n    button_text: Fetch\n  ocr_api_key:\n    placeholder: Enter your API key\n  outline_color:\n    button_text: '...'\nflow_steps:\n  detection: 📝 Detection\n  ocr: 🔍 OCR\n  translation: 🧠 Translation\n  inpainting: 🧼 Inpainting\n  rendering: ✒️ Rendering\n  read_text: 📄 Read Text\n  save_text: 💾 Save Text\n  save_raw: 💾 Save RAW Output\n  upscale: ✨ Upscale\n  save_image: 💾 Save Image\n  colorize: 🎨 Colorize\n  hardsub: 🔤 Hardsub\n  reletter: ✒️ Reletter\nenums:\n  cpu: CPU\n  cuda: NVIDIA GPU\n  offline: Offline\n  api: AI / Online\n  standalone: Standalone API\n  pool: Pool APIs\n  '1': '1'\n  '2': '2'\n  '3': '3'\n  '4': '4'\n  horizontal_rtl: 'Horizontal: Right-to-Left'\n  horizontal_ltr: 'Horizontal: Left-to-Right'\n  vertical_rtl: 'Vertical: Right-to-Left'\n  vertical_ltr: 'Vertical: Left-to-Right'\n  png: png\n  jpg: jpg\n  webp: webp\n  pdf: pdf\n  psd: psd\n  xcf: xcf\n  new_safe: Create New Folder (Avoid Overwrite)\n  new_overwrite: Create New Folder (Overwrite Existing)\n  inplace: Translate In-Place (Modify Original)\n  ram: RAM\n  disk: DISK\n  yes: Yes\n  no: No\n  english: English\n  tiếng_việt: Vietnamese\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
