{"step_index":1057,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-07-11T14:29:12Z","content":"Created At: 2026-07-11T14:29:12Z\nCompleted At: 2026-07-11T14:29:12Z\nFile Path: `file:///home/bimatkeo/Documents/Translator/Bimatkeo_Translator/default_configs/langs/en.yaml`\nTotal Lines: 264\nTotal Bytes: 11630\nShowing lines 1 to 60\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: language_name: English\n2: tabs:\n3:   General & Translator: General & Translator\n4:   Detector & OCR: Detector & OCR\n5:   Image & Inpainter: Image & Inpainter\n6:   Render & Output: Render & Output\n7:   Extra Settings: Extra Settings\n8: tasks:\n9:   raw_output:\n10:     label: RAW Output\n11:     description: Removes text from the images, leaving blank speech bubbles. This task does not perform any translation.\n12:   upscale:\n13:     label: Image Upscaling\n14:     description: Increases the resolution of images using a selected AI model, without any other modifications.\n15:   colorize:\n16:     label: Image Colorization\n17:     description: Colorizes black & white images, while attempting to preserve text areas by detecting them first.\n18:   extract_translate:\n19:     label: Extract & Translate\n20:     description: Extracts and translates text from images without rendering it back onto the image. Outputs translated text files.\n21:   inpaint_only:\n22:     label: Clean/Inpaint Only\n23:     description: Detects and removes text from images, leaving clean speech bubbles without any translation or rendering.\n24:   text_only_translation:\n25:     label: Pure Text Translation (.txt)\n26:     description: Translates text files (.txt) line by line from one language to another. No image processing is involved.\n27: settings:\n28:   processing_device:\n29:     label: 'Processing Device:'\n30:     tooltip: Use CPU for universal compatibility or NVIDIA GPU for significantly faster processing (requires a compatible card and setup).\n31:   target_lang:\n32:     label: 'Target Language:'\n33:     tooltip: The language to translate the text into.\n34:   translator_category:\n35:     label: 'Translator Type:'\n36:     tooltip: Choose between offline local translation models or online APIs.\n37:   api_name:\n38:     label: 'API Name:'\n39:     tooltip: Select an existing API profile or type a name to create/save a new one.\n40:   offline_translator:\n41:     label: 'Offline Model:'\n42:     tooltip: Select the offline local model to translate text.\n43:   ai_translator:\n44:     label: 'AI Provider:'\n45:     tooltip: Select the AI service/API provider to translate text.\n46:   ai_endpoint:\n47:     label: 'API Endpoint:'\n48:     tooltip: Base URL/Endpoint of the selected AI service.\n49:     placeholder: e.g., https://api.openai.com/v1\n50:   ai_model:\n51:     label: 'Model Name:'\n52:     tooltip: Model name for the translation service. Click 'Fetch' to query available models from the endpoint.\n53:     placeholder: e.g., gemini-2.5-flash\n54:     button_text: Fetch\n55:   ai_key:\n56:     label: 'API Key:'\n57:     tooltip: Secret API Key for authenticating with the selected service.\n58:     placeholder: Enter your API key\n59:   enable_translator_chain:\n60:     label: 'Enable Translator Chain:'\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
