{"step_index":2626,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-07-12T11:04:14Z","thinking":"**Prioritizing Tool Usage**\n\nI'm now focusing on tool selection, emphasizing specific tools over general ones where possible. The goal is to optimize efficiency by leveraging tools tailored to particular tasks, like viewing files. This strategy promises a more targeted and less error-prone approach to problem-solving, which I will continue to refine and implement moving forward.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Walkthrough of the completed defragmentation of core modules (downloader, ocr, api_profile, hugging_face, fonts) and fixing the logging recursion bug.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Refactoring & Defragmentation Walkthrough\\n\\nI have completed the defragmentation of the core modules as planned, and also investigated and fixed the recursion bug in the localization logger that was causing the `Output Export` error.\\n\\n## 1. Resolved Recursion Bug in Language Logger\\nThe `Output Export` error (and UI launch crash) was caused by an infinite recursion loop inside `app.core.langs.manager.py`:\\n- `LanguageManager` attempted to log a warning when a string ID was missing.\\n- The `app.core.desktop.logic.logger` handler captured this warning.\\n- The logger handler attempted to translate the log message using `LanguageManager.get_string(...)`.\\n- `get_string` couldn't find the string and logged another warning, causing infinite recursion.\\n- **Fix:** Removed the `logger.warning` calls from `get_string` and `get_ui_string`. Missing string verification is now strictly handled by `LanguageVerifier.run_verification(raw_ui_map)` at startup, satisfying the requirement to report missing translations strictly via the `verify` mechanism.\\n- I also manually cleaned up a duplicate key (`ui_btn_open_yaml`) in `vi.yaml` that was causing `ruamel.yaml` parsing errors.\\n\\n## 2. Defragmented `app/core/downloader`\\n- Merged `exceptions.py` and `task.py` into a single `models.py`.\\n- Merged `cache.py`, `checksum.py`, and `extract.py` into a single `utils.py`.\\n- Merged `executor.py` and `download.py` directly into `manager.py`.\\n- Restored `ModelDownloader` backward compatibility adapter in `__init__.py`.\\n\\n## 3. Defragmented `app/core/ocr`\\n- Merged `cropper.py`, `filter.py`, `geometry.py`, `preprocessor.py`, and `rotator.py` into a single comprehensive `image_utils.py`.\\n- Inlined the very short `recognizer.py` wrapper logic directly into `local_runner.py`'s `_recognize_crop` method.\\n- Cleaned up imports and deleted the fragmented files.\\n\\n## 4. Refactored `app/core/api_profile`\\n- Relocated and merged `paths.py`, `reader.py`, and `writer.py` from the `api_profile` directory directly into `app/core/api/profile/pro\n<truncated 531 bytes>","Description":"\"Create walkthrough\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/home/bimatkeo/.gemini/antigravity-ide/brain/7bd6321d-60a5-40eb-b31b-dd30ae523d71/walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Write walkthrough\"","toolSummary":"\"Create walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
